  "jigokuhen|1969": {"id":82547,"poster":"/jI6WcD80g3FXhjlDGC3V4kfSK2X.jpg","title":"地獄変","title_en":"Portrait of Hell","overview_en":"The story, set in the Heian era, depicts the conflict between Korean painter Yoshihide (Nakadai) and his Japanese patron, the cruel and egotistical daimyo Horikawa (Nakamura).  It is based on the 1918 short story Hell Screen by Ryūnosuke Akutagawa.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,27],"vote_average":7.917,"vote_count":12,"imdb_id":"tt0064512","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/portrait_of_hell/","imdb_rating":7.3,"imdb_votes":364},
  "josephine baker – ikone der befreiung|2018": {"id":591517,"poster":"/p6FX5kqVkgu9p3PlHg9e7On4Rx0.jpg","title":"Josephine Baker, Ikone der Befreiung","title_en":"Josephine Baker: The Story of an Awakening","overview":"Im Jahr 1925 verließ die junge schwarze Varieté-Tänzerin Josephine Baker die USA und machte sich auf den Weg nach Europa. Sie entfloh der Rassentrennung und versuchte ihr Glück in Paris. In nur einer Nacht wurde sie zum Liebling der französischen Metropole. Ihr \"Danse sauvage\" sorgte für Furore auf dem alten Kontinent. Eine Dokumentation über Bakers politisches Erwachen.","overview_en":"How did a poor little black girl from Missouri become the Queen of Paris, before joining the French Resistance and finally creating her dream family “The Rainbow Tribe”, adopting twelve children from four corners of the world? This is the fabulous story of the first black superstar, Josephine Baker.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99,10402],"vote_average":7.929,"vote_count":7,"imdb_id":"tt9406402","imdb_rating":7.6,"imdb_votes":145},
  "jubiläumsfilmreihe: 200 motels|1971": {"id":27645,"poster":"/bLwx4NoyPPiOtKjKT2OsFkxFgnm.jpg","title":"200 Motels","title_en":"200 Motels","overview":"In diesem unerhört psychedelischen Vorläufer der heutigen Musikvideos des großen Frank Zappa richten die „Mothers of Invention“ in einer typischen amerikanischen Stadt Chaos an. Ringo Starr ist der Erzähler.","overview_en":"\"Touring makes you crazy,\" Frank Zappa says, explaining that the idea for this film came to him while the Mothers of Invention were touring. The story, interspersed with performances by the Mothers and the Royal Symphony Orchestra, is a tale of life on the road. The band members' main concerns are the search for groupies and the desire to get paid.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[14,35,10402],"vote_average":5.198,"vote_count":48,"imdb_id":"tt0066732","rt_critic":50,"imdb_rating":5.6,"imdb_votes":2412,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/frank_zappa_two_hundred_motels/"},
