  "kōkaku kidōtai/ghost in the shell|*": {"id":1104401,"poster":"/jO7BY7hQq5Re7rX8nEgev5PmJI9.jpg","title":"攻殻機動隊 SAC_2045 最後の人間","title_en":"Ghost in the Shell: SAC_2045 The Last Human","overview_en":"In 2045, amidst an economic disaster and the rapid evolution of AI in a world where sustainable warfare is on the rise, Public Security Section 9, led by Motoko Kusanagi, arrives in Tokyo to confront the \"post-human\" Takashi Shimamura and prevent the looming threat of nuclear war. A compilation film with newly added footage.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,28,878],"vote_average":6.9,"vote_count":10,"imdb_id":"tt32339908","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ghost_in_the_shell_sac_2045_the_last_human","imdb_votes":10},
