  "mag mag|2025": {"id":1492608,"poster":"/gzkn4qkCFXE4GJ0aJNdGVI97kbs.jpg","title":"John Candy: Ich mag mich","title_en":"John Candy: I Like Me","overview":"Die, die John Candy am besten kannten, teilen seine Geschichte, in ihren eigenen Worten, mithilfe von nie gesehenem Archivmaterial, Fotos und Interviews. Es ist eine Dokumentation über das Leben, die Karriere und den Verlust eines der beliebtesten Comedy-Schauspieler aller Zeiten.","overview_en":"Those who knew iconic funnyman John Candy best share his story, in their own words, through never-before-seen archival footage, imagery, and interviews.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":97,"imdb_id":"tt26683420","rt_critic":89,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/john_candy_i_like_me","imdb_rating":8,"imdb_votes":11114},
