  "nie wieder liebe|*": {"id":285787,"poster":"/l1PVEi4Vma75bwTYPE2iTbgVj0d.jpg","title":"Nie wieder Liebe","title_en":"No More Love","overview":"Der reiche Playboy Sandercroft hat sich nach vielen Enttäuschungen mit den Frauen entschlossen in den nächsten 5 Jahren unter dem Motto \"Nie wieder Liebe!\" zu leben. Sein Freund Jack wettet eine halbe Million Dollar dagegen, dass er dies niemals durchhalten würde.","overview_en":"An American millionaire, who had always bad luck with women, bets that he can live without them for five years. But after four and a half years traveling around on his yacht, he rescues a lady from drowning in the English Channel.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[10402,35],"vote_average":7.625,"vote_count":4,"imdb_id":"tt0022202","imdb_rating":6.6,"imdb_votes":50},
