  "obsession - du sollst mich lieben|*": {"id":1339713,"poster":"/3782xFmwXK6FQvGaoVgT0sja2OO.jpg","title":"Obsession - Du sollst mich lieben","title_en":"Obsession","overview":"Nachdem er die geheimnisvolle „Wunschweide“ zerbrochen hat, um das Herz seiner Angebeteten zu gewinnen, erhält ein hoffnungsloser Romantiker genau das, was er sich gewünscht hat, muss aber bald feststellen, dass manche Wünsche einen dunklen, finsteren Preis haben.","overview_en":"After breaking the mysterious \"One Wish Willow\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[27],"vote_average":7.927,"vote_count":524,"imdb_id":"tt37287335","rt_critic":95,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/obsession_2025","imdb_rating":8.2,"imdb_votes":50183},
