  "once upon a time in venezuela|2020": {"id":653757,"poster":"/qqYRkF6T31BWJjFapIda8jHizGy.jpg","overview_en":"Once upon a time, the Venezuelan village of Congo Mirador was prosperous, alive with fisherman and poets. Now it is decaying and disintegrating—a small but prophetic reflection of Venezuela itself.","kind":"movie"},
  "one battle after another|*": {"id":1054867,"poster":"/5k2WV1i6jcnbPmRhoXSEQWQGT9u.jpg","title":"One Battle After Another","title_en":"One Battle After Another","overview":"Vor 16 Jahren hat die Widerstandsgruppe namens „French 75“ auf einen Schlag 200 Häftlinge aus den Fängen des skrupellosen United States Immigration and Customs Enforcement – kurz: ICE – befreit. Danach verschwanden die Widerständler, darunter auch der von allen nur Ghetto Pat genannte Bob Ferguson, von der Bildfläche. Heute ist Bob getrieben von Paranoia, denn er fürchtet, dass es der damalige ICE-Colonel Steven J. Lockjaw immer noch auf ihn abgesehen hat.","overview_en":"Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[53,80,35],"vote_average":7.361,"vote_count":3666,"imdb_id":"tt30144839","rt_critic":94,"imdb_rating":7.7,"imdb_votes":397927,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/one_battle_after_another"},
  "one battle after another|2025": {"id":1054867,"poster":"/5k2WV1i6jcnbPmRhoXSEQWQGT9u.jpg","title":"One Battle After Another","title_en":"One Battle After Another","overview":"Vor 16 Jahren hat die Widerstandsgruppe namens „French 75“ auf einen Schlag 200 Häftlinge aus den Fängen des skrupellosen United States Immigration and Customs Enforcement – kurz: ICE – befreit. Danach verschwanden die Widerständler, darunter auch der von allen nur Ghetto Pat genannte Bob Ferguson, von der Bildfläche. Heute ist Bob getrieben von Paranoia, denn er fürchtet, dass es der damalige ICE-Colonel Steven J. Lockjaw immer noch auf ihn abgesehen hat.","overview_en":"Washed-up revolutionary Bob exists in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited, self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces after 16 years and she goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her, father and daughter both battling the consequences of his past.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[53,80,35],"vote_average":7.361,"vote_count":3666,"imdb_id":"tt30144839","rt_critic":94,"imdb_rating":7.7,"imdb_votes":397927,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/one_battle_after_another"},
  "one of those days when hemme dies (hemme’nin öldüğü günlerden biri)|*": {"id":1320279,"poster":"/91aCzYUPoy8HEpeSD0erw6whgLm.jpg","title":"One of Those Days When Hemme Dies","title_en":"One of Those Days When Hemme Dies","overview":"Eyüp braucht nach seiner Geschäftspleite dringend Geld. So beschließt er, trotz sengender Hitze auf einer Tomatenfarm zu arbeiten, um schnell seine Schulden abzahlen zu können. Der Vorarbeiter Hemme hat es jedoch nicht so eilig mit der Bezahlung, was bald zu Konflikten führt – und ersten Mordgedanken.","overview_en":"Eyüp works relentlessly under the blazing sun during a tomato harvest in southeastern Turkey, driven by the urgent need to settle an impending debt. After a clash with his supervisor, he roams the city in search of a radical solution.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":5.8,"vote_count":13,"imdb_id":"tt33030347","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/one_of_those_days_when_hemme_dies"},
