  "sari mercedes|1992": {"id":300953,"poster":"/y4Kc3GRvbLUpKNgGWLF4Yzk23O2.jpg","title":"Sarı Mercedes","title_en":"The Yellow Mercedes","overview":"Mercedes mon Amour ist ein Komödie aus dem Jahr 1992 von Tunç Okan mit Ilyas Salman und Valerie Lemoine.  In Mercedes mon Amour begeben sich ein Mann und sein brandneues Auto auf eine Reise quer durch die Türkei, die einer von beiden nicht überleben wird.","overview_en":"The film is based on 'Fikrimin Ince Gulu', a novel by Adalet Agaoglu, which depicts a first generation gurbetci/guest-worker returning home. It covers his land journey in short bursts from Germany to the Turkey's west border - and extensively from thereon to his village close to Ankara - capital of Turkey. He begins his journey purchasing a second hand yellow Mercedes - possibly his first car - using his meager savings working as a laborer. Offering deep insight into the mind of a manual laborer Bayram (Ilyas Salman) making his first trip back home, resorting to flashbacks in highlighting Bayram's motivation and experiences from his childhood right up to the events leading to his first departure from Turkey to Germany.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[35,28,18],"vote_average":7.651,"vote_count":43,"imdb_id":"tt0200637","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/mercedes_mon_amour_2013/","imdb_rating":7.8,"imdb_votes":3114},
