  "türkisches filmfestival: curtain | perde|2025": {"id":1552750,"poster":"/9i0go6pWIjIKhu5csUGyqotQQNA.jpg","title":"Perde","title_en":"Curtain","overview_en":"Samet invites his friends over to celebrate his promotion to general manager. While feeding the cats before entering the house, he sees the woman on the ground floor undressing and runs away when she notices him, which leads to the doorman being blamed. His wife Zeynep, who has always defended the doorman while discussing this issue with her friends, will she defend what she believes is right when she learns that Samet is the real culprit? Or will she protect her interests?","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[35,18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt38349293","imdb_votes":9},
