  "türkisches filmfestival: ghost bastard|*": {"id":1477435,"poster":"/72u1gQXUj0qc7vOJAoR6fUH38pK.jpg","title":"Ghost Bastard","title_en":"Ghost Bastard","overview":"Elli wird plötzlich von einem zynischen Geist heimgesucht, den niemand sonst sehen kann. Widerwillig geht sie einen Deal ein: Sie wird dem Geist helfen, Frieden zu finden, und im Gegenzug verspricht er, sie bei ihren Schulalltagsproblemen zu unterstützen. Während ihrer ungewöhnlichen Zusammenarbeit decken sie Mikes vergessene Vergangenheit auf, während Elli sich ihren eigenen Problemen stellen muss. Auf dieser Reise lernen beide etwas über Vergebung und die wahre Bedeutung ihrer Verbindung. Am Ende steht Elli vor einer schwierigen Entscheidung, die über Mikes ewiges Schicksal entscheiden wird.","overview_en":"Elli is suddenly haunted by a cynical ghost that no one else can see. Reluctantly, she makes a deal: she will help the ghost find peace, and in return he promises to help her with her everyday school problems. During their unusual collaboration, they uncover Mike's forgotten past, while Elli has to face her own problems. On this journey, they both learn about forgiveness and the true meaning of their connection. In the end, Elli is faced with a difficult decision that will decide Mike's eternal fate.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[35,14,18],"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":1,"imdb_id":"tt33653396"},
  "türkisches filmfestival: gülizar|2024": {"id":1318099,"poster":"/69FSQfR1V3NH1FACDP1woquIXB7.jpg","title":"Gülizar","title_en":"Gülizar","overview_en":"After Gülizar is sexually assaulted, her future husband Emre does not report the incident, but later decides to go after the attacker himself. Gülizar's wedding preparations slowly turn into a claustrophobic, silent journey as she fears that her attacker will be exposed. Her flame of silence burns not only herself, but also the love she feels for Emre.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":6,"vote_count":1,"imdb_id":"tt28089996","imdb_votes":22},
  "türkisches filmfestival: not what you think | bildiğin gibi değil|2024": {"id":1091642,"poster":"/nzMbrB4UCZw7AFvD4qOmgwcT1Uv.jpg","title":"Bildiğin Gibi Değil","title_en":"Not What You Think","overview_en":"Three very different siblings reunite in their hometown Tokat after their father's mysterious death, where shifting alliances, buried memories, and tangled bonds reveal that nothing about their past is as they believed.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":6,"vote_count":1,"imdb_id":"tt15004576","imdb_votes":51},
  "türkisches filmfestival: one of those days when hemme dies | hemme’nin öldüğü günlerden biri|*": {"id":1320279,"poster":"/91aCzYUPoy8HEpeSD0erw6whgLm.jpg","title":"One of Those Days When Hemme Dies","title_en":"One of Those Days When Hemme Dies","overview":"Eyüp braucht nach seiner Geschäftspleite dringend Geld. So beschließt er, trotz sengender Hitze auf einer Tomatenfarm zu arbeiten, um schnell seine Schulden abzahlen zu können. Der Vorarbeiter Hemme hat es jedoch nicht so eilig mit der Bezahlung, was bald zu Konflikten führt – und ersten Mordgedanken.","overview_en":"Eyüp works relentlessly under the blazing sun during a tomato harvest in southeastern Turkey, driven by the urgent need to settle an impending debt. After a clash with his supervisor, he roams the city in search of a radical solution.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":5.8,"vote_count":13,"imdb_id":"tt33030347","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/one_of_those_days_when_hemme_dies"},
