  "türkisches filmfestival: radio, my love | biz radyoyu çok sevdik|2025": {"id":1477530,"poster":"/wxuHqqUbuIgvD7SP4XXSVheV6rz.jpg","title":"Biz Radyoyu Çok Sevdik","title_en":"Radio, My Love","overview_en":"The documentary defines radio broadcasting as an area of ​​struggle and builds its story through the narratives of women who worked as radio broadcasters in the 1970s. The origin of the documentary is the oral history project titled \"Women Radio Broadcasters in the History of Türkiye.\"","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
  "türkisches filmfestival: the secret on the canvas | tuvaldeki sır|2025": {"id":1566251,"poster":"/RZ0ndsmkwt2AVGAYEyUCuVxuCw.jpg","title":"Tuvaldeki Sır","title_en":"The Secret on the Canvas","overview_en":"The Secret on the Canvas is a dramatic story set in Cyprus, woven with love, betrayal, and secrets buried years ago. Screenwriter Mert, who comes to the island in search of inspiration, finds traces of the forbidden love that painter Ayten had with a Greek Cypriot youth named Nikos in her youth. This discovery leads him to the dark secrets of the past, and during his research, his path crosses with Zehra's, and together they try to uncover a truth that has been hidden for generations.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
